{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf040:l002", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 40, "folio": 423, "line_in_page": 2, "raw": "Бир козголуу калалы,", "text": "Бир козголуу калалы,", "en": "Let us all stir together,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The middle word is difficult; translation follows a contextual reading of козголуу.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf040:l003", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 40, "folio": 423, "line_in_page": 3, "raw": "Кырганда барган чок салат,", "text": "Кырганда барган чок салат,", "en": "When he strikes them down, he casts fire,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Several letters are faint; this is a completion-first reading.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf040:l004", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 40, "folio": 423, "line_in_page": 4, "raw": "Оң Киёордон кеп угуп,", "text": "Оң Киёордон кеп угуп,", "en": "Hearing word from the good Kiyoor,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The proper name appears to be Киёор and awaits comparison with adjacent leaves.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf040:l005", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 40, "folio": 423, "line_in_page": 5, "raw": "Киёо жаман сураба,", "text": "Киёо жаман сураба,", "en": "Do not ask ill of Kiyoo,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The proper name and final imperative are somewhat faint.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf040:l006", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 40, "folio": 423, "line_in_page": 6, "raw": "Бу дүйнөдө өзү ачык,", "text": "Бу дүйнөдө өзү ачык,", "en": "In this world he himself is discerning,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf040:l007", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 40, "folio": 423, "line_in_page": 7, "raw": "Өлгөнүндө көзү ачык,", "text": "Өлгөнүндө көзү ачык,", "en": "Even in death his eyes are open,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf040:l008", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 40, "folio": 423, "line_in_page": 8, "raw": "Ата сыны эр болуп,", "text": "Ата сыны эр болуп,", "en": "Bearing his father’s likeness, he became a hero,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The word сыны is a best-effort reading.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf040:l009", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 40, "folio": 423, "line_in_page": 9, "raw": "Артык бакыт көрүптүр,", "text": "Артык бакыт көрүптүр,", "en": "He had known surpassing fortune,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf040:l010", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 40, "folio": 423, "line_in_page": 10, "raw": "Андан менен үймүлүп,", "text": "Андан менен үймүлүп,", "en": "Gathering there together,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The first word and verb ending are faint.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf040:l011", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 40, "folio": 423, "line_in_page": 11, "raw": "Төрттөн барып көрүптүр,", "text": "Төрттөн барып көрүптүр,", "en": "They went in fours and looked,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The numeral may have another reading; төрттөн is clearest visually.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf040:l012", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 40, "folio": 423, "line_in_page": 12, "raw": "Бүлүм менен жабылып,", "text": "Бүлүм менен жабылып,", "en": "Covered all about in divisions,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The first noun is difficult and may be бүлүм.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf040:l013", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 40, "folio": 423, "line_in_page": 13, "raw": "Тубан барып көрүптүр,", "text": "Тубан барып көрүптүр,", "en": "They went down below and looked,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf040:l014", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 40, "folio": 423, "line_in_page": 14, "raw": "Айылы кандай конду деп,", "text": "Айылы кандай конду деп,", "en": "Wondering how his encampment had settled,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf040:l015", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 40, "folio": 423, "line_in_page": 15, "raw": "Айласы кандай болду деп,", "text": "Айласы кандай болду деп,", "en": "Wondering what his stratagem had become,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf040:l016", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 40, "folio": 423, "line_in_page": 16, "raw": "Сынап барып көрүптүр.", "text": "Сынап барып көрүптүр.", "en": "They went to test it and see.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf040:l017", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 40, "folio": 423, "line_in_page": 17, "raw": "Дүйнөсү, дөөлөтү,", "text": "Дүйнөсү, дөөлөтү,", "en": "His wealth and his abundance,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf040:l018", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 40, "folio": 423, "line_in_page": 18, "raw": "Жерге батпай жатыптыр.", "text": "Жерге батпай жатыптыр.", "en": "Lay there too vast for the earth to hold.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf040:l019", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 40, "folio": 423, "line_in_page": 19, "raw": "Ал Кенендин катына,", "text": "Ал Кенендин катына,", "en": "To that wife of Kenen,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The case ending is pale; Kenen is clear.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf040:l020", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 40, "folio": 423, "line_in_page": 20, "raw": "Удаа эркек төрөптүр,", "text": "Удаа эркек төрөптүр,", "en": "She bore sons one after another,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf040:l021", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 40, "folio": 423, "line_in_page": 21, "raw": "Атын уйкаш уулун коюптур,", "text": "Атын уйкаш уулун коюптур,", "en": "She gave her sons rhyming names,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The manuscript wording is compressed; sense follows атын уйкаш.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf040:l022", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 40, "folio": 423, "line_in_page": 22, "raw": "Мурун төрөөгө сынчы барыптыр.", "text": "Мурун төрөөгө сынчы барыптыр.", "en": "Before the birth, a seer had gone there.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Several medial letters are faint; төрөөгө сынчы is the probable reading.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf040:l023", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 40, "folio": 423, "line_in_page": 23, "raw": "Бир падыша калгандай,", "text": "Бир падыша калгандай,", "en": "As though a sovereign had remained,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The noun looks like падыша but is lightly written.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf040:l024", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 40, "folio": 423, "line_in_page": 24, "raw": "Куруучу малын союптур,", "text": "Куруучу малын союптур,", "en": "They slaughtered livestock in abundance,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Initial word is difficult; translation conveys the apparent feast context.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf040:l025", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 40, "folio": 423, "line_in_page": 25, "raw": "Эң бир кызык табышып,", "text": "Эң бир кызык табышып,", "en": "Finding the greatest delight,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf040:l026", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 40, "folio": 423, "line_in_page": 26, "raw": "Жыйналайык жылкы баш,", "text": "Жыйналайык жылкы баш,", "en": "“Let us gather the foremost horses,”", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Final phrase is read as жылкы баш; punctuation supplied.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf040:l027", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 40, "folio": 423, "line_in_page": 27, "raw": "Таз менен туз кылгандай,", "text": "Таз менен туз кылгандай,", "en": "As though sharing salt with the bald man,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The idiomatic force and first noun require later review.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf040:l028", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 40, "folio": 423, "line_in_page": 28, "raw": "Онко менен табышып,", "text": "Онко менен табышып,", "en": "Meeting together with Onko,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Онко is treated as a proper name, though the reading is uncertain.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf040:l029", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 40, "folio": 423, "line_in_page": 29, "raw": "Жетишерлик жеккени,", "text": "Жетишерлик жеккени,", "en": "What he had driven was enough to suffice,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Both verb and syntax are difficult; completion-first translation.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf040:l030", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 40, "folio": 423, "line_in_page": 30, "raw": "Жети сабаа бүлдүрүп,", "text": "Жети сабаа бүлдүрүп,", "en": "Ruining seven great leather vessels,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Final verb is faint; сабаа denotes a large vessel or churn.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf040:l031", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 40, "folio": 423, "line_in_page": 31, "raw": "Бир маалысыз чагы болду,", "text": "Бир маалысыз чагы болду,", "en": "There came a time beyond all measure,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The middle wording is faint and has been normalized conservatively.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf040:l032", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 40, "folio": 423, "line_in_page": 32, "raw": "Байкап турган пендеден.", "text": "Байкап турган пендеден.", "en": "From the mortal who stood watching.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The closing construction depends on the next leaf; пендеден is clear.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf041:l001", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 41, "folio": 424, "line_in_page": 1, "raw": "Жанын калбай куудуруп.", "text": "Жанын калбай куудуруп.", "en": "Driving them on without sparing a soul.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The pale first phrase is read as Жанын калбай.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf041:l002", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 41, "folio": 424, "line_in_page": 2, "raw": "Жетимиштен кырк калды дейт,", "text": "Жетимиштен кырк калды дейт,", "en": "They say forty remained out of seventy,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The numeral phrase is pale but reasonably legible.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf041:l003", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 41, "folio": 424, "line_in_page": 3, "raw": "Жүз кыскарак балбандан,", "text": "Жүз кыскарак балбандан,", "en": "From a hundred lesser champions,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The adjective after жүз is a completion-first reading.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf041:l004", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 41, "folio": 424, "line_in_page": 4, "raw": "Жетпени морал алды дейт.", "text": "Жетпени морал алды дейт.", "en": "They say he took what had not been reached.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The middle word looks like морал but remains lexically unclear; English follows the surrounding sense.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf041:l005", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 41, "folio": 424, "line_in_page": 5, "raw": "Кан баатыр ой калды,", "text": "Кан баатыр ой калды,", "en": "The khan-hero was left deep in thought,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The first two words are faint and may contain a different epithet.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf041:l006", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 41, "folio": 424, "line_in_page": 6, "raw": "Катылып тура кыргыздар,", "text": "Катылып тура кыргыздар,", "en": "The Kyrgyz stood ready to attack,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The verb is read as катылып; handwriting is pale.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf041:l007", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 41, "folio": 424, "line_in_page": 7, "raw": "Надооладай той калды,", "text": "Надооладай той калды,", "en": "A feast vast as Nadoola remained,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The comparison name/word Надооладай is uncertain.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf041:l008", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 41, "folio": 424, "line_in_page": 8, "raw": "Токсон эки эмине,", "text": "Токсон эки эмине,", "en": "What are ninety-two,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The numeral construction is legible; its syntax depends on adjacent lines.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf041:l009", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 41, "folio": 424, "line_in_page": 9, "raw": "Барбасынан тагына,", "text": "Барбасынан тагына,", "en": "Again from his going,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The first word may be a different inflected form.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf041:l010", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 41, "folio": 424, "line_in_page": 10, "raw": "Конгон эки эмине.", "text": "Конгон эки эмине.", "en": "What are the two who settled.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The line is pale and the contextual force of эки эмине is uncertain.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf041:l011", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 41, "folio": 424, "line_in_page": 11, "raw": "Ай-амалдуу бул калбай,", "text": "Ай-амалдуу бул калбай,", "en": "Leaving none of these cunning schemes unused,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The compound at the start is uncertain.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf041:l012", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 41, "folio": 424, "line_in_page": 12, "raw": "Айт деген ушун иш,", "text": "Айт деген ушун иш,", "en": "This is the deed called speaking out,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The first word is faint; contextual translation is provisional.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf041:l013", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 41, "folio": 424, "line_in_page": 13, "raw": "Канкор изден бир муштум,", "text": "Канкор изден бир муштум,", "en": "A single fist from the bloodthirsty one’s track,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The phrase after Канкор is difficult and may have another reading.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf041:l014", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 41, "folio": 424, "line_in_page": 14, "raw": "Калай деген ушун иш.", "text": "Калай деген ушун иш.", "en": "This is the deed called Kalay.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Калай may be a name or a common word; meaning is uncertain.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf041:l015", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 41, "folio": 424, "line_in_page": 15, "raw": "Жалгыз баладан кол жыйса,", "text": "Жалгыз баладан кол жыйса,", "en": "If the lone youth gathers an army,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The noun бала may instead be a related form.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf041:l016", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 41, "folio": 424, "line_in_page": 16, "raw": "Каардан төгүп бакырса,", "text": "Каардан төгүп бакырса,", "en": "If he pours out his rage and roars,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The opening word is faint but fits the context.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf041:l017", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 41, "folio": 424, "line_in_page": 17, "raw": "Карагак чыгып чокорсо,", "text": "Карагак чыгып чокорсо,", "en": "If Karagak comes forth and strikes,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The proper name and final verb are uncertain completion-first readings.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf041:l018", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 41, "folio": 424, "line_in_page": 18, "raw": "Асманга учат топурак,", "text": "Асманга учат топурак,", "en": "Dust flies up to the sky,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf041:l019", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 41, "folio": 424, "line_in_page": 19, "raw": "Аскер кайдан топурап,", "text": "Аскер кайдан топурап,", "en": "From where does the army mass together,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The final verb is read as топурап and may echo the prior line.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf041:l020", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 41, "folio": 424, "line_in_page": 20, "raw": "Жер айрылган дуу болсо,", "text": "Жер айрылган дуу болсо,", "en": "If there is a din that splits the earth,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf041:l021", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 41, "folio": 424, "line_in_page": 21, "raw": "Кулак жарган чуу болсо,", "text": "Кулак жарган чуу болсо,", "en": "If there is an uproar that bursts the ears,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf041:l022", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 41, "folio": 424, "line_in_page": 22, "raw": "Көзү кыйса Карала,", "text": "Көзү кыйса Карала,", "en": "If Karala’s eye has the heart for it,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The proper name and idiom are uncertain.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf041:l023", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 41, "folio": 424, "line_in_page": 23, "raw": "Кайра баштап чордонсо,", "text": "Кайра баштап чордонсо,", "en": "If he begins again and gathers his warriors,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The last verb is difficult; translation follows an apparent gathering sense.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf041:l024", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 41, "folio": 424, "line_in_page": 24, "raw": "Кан коругун журт десе,", "text": "Кан коругун журт десе,", "en": "If the people call it the khan’s preserve,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The first phrase is pale and may be segmented differently.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf041:l025", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 41, "folio": 424, "line_in_page": 25, "raw": "Кара талаа мына бу иш,", "text": "Кара талаа мына бу иш,", "en": "This deed is the black open steppe,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The idiomatic force of the line is uncertain.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf041:l026", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 41, "folio": 424, "line_in_page": 26, "raw": "Окулдаган мылтыгы —", "text": "Окулдаган мылтыгы —", "en": "His musket booming—", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The weapon noun is clear; punctuation reflects the manuscript continuation.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf041:l027", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 41, "folio": 424, "line_in_page": 27, "raw": "Агын төгүп албасак,", "text": "Агын төгүп албасак,", "en": "If we do not spill their flowing blood and take it,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The opening noun is uncertain; translation is contextual.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf041:l028", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 41, "folio": 424, "line_in_page": 28, "raw": "Акыл балбан иш кылып,", "text": "Акыл балбан иш кылып,", "en": "If the wise champion does his work,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The first word may be Акыл as a name or adjective.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf041:l029", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 41, "folio": 424, "line_in_page": 29, "raw": "Бир улуу дүңгү салбасак.", "text": "Бир улуу дүңгү салбасак.", "en": "If we do not raise one great thunderous tumult.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The noun дүңгү is a best-effort reading.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf041:l030", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 41, "folio": 424, "line_in_page": 30, "raw": "Эр туулган Көк Теңир,", "text": "Эр туулган Көк Теңир,", "en": "The hero was born by Blue Heaven,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The divine name is pale but appears to be Көк Теңир.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf041:l031", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 41, "folio": 424, "line_in_page": 31, "raw": "Тоолайбыз калдык,", "text": "Тоолайбыз калдык,", "en": "We remained to reckon it up.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The final line is very pale; both transcription and translation are provisional.", "bbox": null}
